@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@orderNo = ORD-0123456789

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create order (replay safely using the same Idempotency-Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-0001

{
  "amount": 199.00,
  "items": [{ "sku": "GAME-CREDIT", "quantity": 1 }],
  "customerUid": "player-123"
}

### Get order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderNo}}

### Current orders, page 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?tab=current&page=1&limit=20

### Order timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderNo}}/timeline

### Report an issue
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderNo}}/report-issue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "DELAY",
  "description": "Order has not progressed for longer than expected"
}

### Provider webhook: payment confirmed (moves PENDING_PAYMENT to QUEUED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/webhooks/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "payment-event-0001",
  "orderNo": "{{orderNo}}",
  "status": "QUEUED"
}

### Correct an invalid UID on FAILED/DELAYED order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderNo}}/correct-uid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerUid": "correct-player-123"
}
